Package: com.iiemb.aiotweaks
Name: AIOTweaks
Version: 1.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: All-in-one personal jailbreak tweak suite for rootless and roothide (Dopamine) — clean Home Screen & Folder labels/TestFlight dots, clean Lock Screen (no Flashlight/Camera/Today View/Camera swipe/long-press wallpaper edit), transparent Dock & global Home Bar, double-tap to sleep, silent Phone keypad, and swipe down in App Switcher to close all apps.
Maintainer: iiemb
Author: iiemb
Section: Tweaks
